# w.lang.en/shards/role-frames: frames written in this repository (Q64): 31 general frames, one for each role of k.actions that no general frame read, built from the role's markers in k.actions ("make a boat out of paper": material by "out of"); and the 9 frames of PSys2's src/lang/en.local.mjs that did not read their own example, fixed and kept here (same names; the import leaves them out, PSys2 deletes its copies). Each frame follows a comment with the role it asks for or what was fixed.
# sources: hand-core 1 (written in this repository: tools/lang-en-role-frames.mjs; the nine moved frames after PSys2 src/lang/en.local.mjs at commit 447a5f9a)
# license: CC0-1.0
# script: tools/lang-en-role-frames.mjs

